  "what_to_update": [
    "Add a TLS/daemon-mode hint: normalize_target() currently discards https:// scheme, so netgauge/websocket/crossdomain always use plain HTTP even when the target is HTTPS-only.",
    "Make legacy fallback port configurable (80 vs target port 8080). The official daemon serves /speedtest/* on 8080 too; the Scribd result schema shows the tester historically used http://<bare-host> on port 80.",
    "Make upload body/response algorithm endpoint-aware: legacy PHP on port 80 uses +502 overhead; OoklaServer daemon on 8080 returns raw Content-Length as size=<body_length>.",
    "Add --ca-bundle / SSL_CERT_FILE support to CLI and web app for lab self-signed CAs; currently relies on system trust or env var.",
    "Consider probing WSS as well as WS when TLS is enabled.",
    "Keep allow_private documented for localhost/lab targets.",
    "Process lifecycle: OoklaServer -d ignored SIGTERM from stop_process once; manual kill -TERM/-KILL was needed.",
    "Legacy fallback zip is 95 MB; store in excluded .cache or re-download, do not commit to the comparison repo."
  ]
